"painting masterpiece"
"Although the painting is old, painted in some distant and forgotten past,

the fine detail and the still-bright colors mark it clearly as a

masterpiece.  Depicted there is a dragon, massive in size, golden scales

glinting brightly, his graceful, translucent wings idle and folded along

his sides.  The great wyrm is coiled around a treasure hoard, his

enormous head at rest atop the pile.  His razor-sharp teeth are bared in

a parody of a smile as he contemplates the objects held in each taloned

hand - in one a suit of ancient mithril scale of dwarven design, in

the other a mouse.  By some trick of light or artistry, his glowing, red

eyes seem to follow each of your movements, as though watching his next

meal.

"
